d","tack weld","weld steel","weld together"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/weld#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:25c2b1686f90d13a18","definition":"The joint made by welding.","example":"Excessive spot weld time may cause the electrode tips to mushroom, resulting in no focus of current and a weak weld.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["all-welded","arc weld","butt-weld","buttweld","cold weld","fillet weld","flash weld","long-welded","spot weld","stick weld","tack weld","weld steel","weld together"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/weld#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:66cf5f3ff7020c25bc","definition":"To wield.","example":"[Arthur says to a wicked giant] \"he that alle the world weldeth gyue the ſorte lyf & ſameful dethe\" (\"He who wields all the world gives thee short life and shameful death\")","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"obsolete","register":"obsolete, transitive","wordFamily":["all-welded","arc weld","butt-weld","buttweld","cold weld","fillet weld","flash weld","long-welded","spot weld","stick weld","tack weld","weld steel","weld together"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/weld#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/wɛld/"},"wordFamily":["all-welded","arc weld","butt-weld","buttweld","cold weld","fillet weld","flash weld","long-welded","spot weld","stick weld","tack weld","weld steel","weld together"]}